<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Associated Estates cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Associated Estates cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons said on Tuesday it had cut its rating for Associated Estates Realty Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Cleveland company closed on Monday at 23-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
